      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 NCCL Validation\n\n**Live and historical NCCL campaign telemetry.** Jobs come from Slurm accounting; terminal state is retained over the selected time range. Correctness acceptance still requires the sealed benchmark receipt\u2014an empty wrong-value signal is never interpreted as PASS.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
